        "fields": {
          "notes": "Work identity follows the current GND work authority. A metadata-only authorial route now distinguishes region-only W II 1 evidence, the split print manuscript D 20a/D 20b, the partial K 11/C 4616 correction-sheet witness, the 1887 first print E 40, unresolved later hand-copy evidence, the source-visible 1892 second Naumann edition, and critical addresses. The Basel digital edition is a remote scholarly representation rather than a historical witness or ToS Item. The exact Wikimedia Commons/UNC scan revision remains separate from the provisional Russian translation in the local Mysl volume."
